		<rdf:type rdf:resource="&v;RangeBoundedCompliancePolicy"/>
		<rdfs:label>design temperature (AII room)</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>CDC (2003) Guidelines for Environmental Infection Control in Health-Care
      Facilities, Appendix B, Table B.2, airborne infection isolation room: 75 F; range 70-75 F from
